SCOPE OF THIS LICENSE / THIRD-PARTY MATERIALS

The MIT license above applies to the code in this repository: the Python tools
and the HTML, CSS, and JavaScript authored for this site. It does not apply to
the following, which are included under separate terms:

1. ASFA DATA — "data/season.json", "data/titles.json", "data/trials.json",
   "data/events.json", "data/clubs.json", the archived pages under
   "data/snapshots/", "data/titles/", "data/trials/", "data/events/" and
   "data/clubs/", and the rule-book text reproduced in "rulebook.html" are
   derived from the Top 20 standings, title listings, trial results, trial
   schedule, club directory and Running Rules published by the American
   Sighthound Field Association (ASFA) at asfa.org. That material remains the
   property of ASFA. It is reproduced here for reference and analysis, with
   attribution, and the ASFA publication is authoritative wherever the two
   disagree.

2. LGRA DATA — "data/lgra.json", "data/lgra-registry.json" and the archived
   snapshots under "data/lgra/" are derived from the grading guide published by
   the Large Gazehound Racing Association (LGRA) at lgra.club. That material
   remains the property of LGRA; the guide and the LGRA Registrar's records are
   authoritative wherever the two disagree.

3. AOK9 DATA — "data/aok9.json", "data/aok9-registry.json" and the archived
   snapshots under "data/aok9/" are derived from the Sprint grading guide
   published by the AOK9 Racing Program of R.A.C.E. (Racing Amateur Canine
   Enthusiasts) at aok9racing.com. That material remains the property of
   R.A.C.E.; the guide and the AOK9 registrar's records are authoritative
   wherever the two disagree.

   In each case the name and marks of ASFA, LGRA, AOK9 and R.A.C.E. are used
   descriptively to identify the source. This project is independent and is not
   authorized, approved, or endorsed by any of them. The raw workbooks the
   guides are distributed as are not stored in this repository.

4. PHOTOGRAPHS — "assets/card-aok9.jpg" is by Susan Wilson and is reproduced
   with credit to the photographer. "assets/card-asfa.jpg" and
   "assets/card-lgra.jpg" are the project maintainer's own. None of the
   photographs is covered by the MIT license above; they are included to
   illustrate this site and may not be reused without the photographer's
   permission.

5. LOGO / ICON FILES — "assets/favicon.ico" (and its root-level copy
   "favicon.ico"), "assets/favicon-16x16.png", "assets/favicon-32x32.png",
   "assets/apple-touch-icon.png", "assets/jackrabbit-icon-40.png", the
   Jackrabbit mark within "assets/og.png", and the inline Jackrabbit mark
   vector in the page header and footer are taken from the Jackrabbit Project
   logo, a brand mark of the project maintainer. They are included to identify
   this project. Nothing in the MIT license above grants rights to use that
   mark for other purposes.

6. WEBFONTS — the files in "assets/fonts/" are the Fraunces typeface
   (Copyright 2019 The Fraunces Project Authors) and the IBM Plex Mono
   typeface (Copyright 2017 IBM Corp.), each licensed under the SIL Open
   Font License, Version 1.1 (https://openfontlicense.org), not the MIT
   license above.
